WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.460
- So your baking show nailed it,

00:00:01.460 --> 00:00:02.930
it was nominated for an Emmy, right?

00:00:02.930 --> 00:00:04.801
- Yes, yes, yes,
- [Kelly] That's crazy!

00:00:04.801 --> 00:00:07.134
(audience claps and cheers)
- Thank you!

00:00:07.134 --> 00:00:08.660
Thank you, we did lose.

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:11.300
We lost to RuPaul's Drag
Race which I get it.

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:12.390
It's my favorite show.

00:00:12.390 --> 00:00:13.290
I truly love it.

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:14.123
- It's hilarious.

00:00:14.123 --> 00:00:14.956
- [Nicole] It's so good.

00:00:14.956 --> 00:00:16.460
- Yeah, did you get to meet anybody cool?

00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:17.800
Have you ever been to the Emmys before?

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:19.442
- No, I've never been to the Emmys.

00:00:19.442 --> 00:00:20.949
- I've only been once, and I felt like

00:00:20.949 --> 00:00:22.189
which one of these is not like the other.

00:00:22.189 --> 00:00:23.240
- [Nicole] Wait, only one time?

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:24.605
- [Kelly] Why the hell
would I be at the Emmys?

00:00:24.605 --> 00:00:26.470
(audience cheers)

00:00:26.470 --> 00:00:28.890
- Beause you're all of our American Idol.

00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:31.680
- No, I just mean, like now
I have a tv show, but before,

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:32.797
you know singers don't
generally just show up.

00:00:32.797 --> 00:00:35.410
- Oh, I guess so, well,
it was my first Emmys.

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:36.720
It was very glamorous.

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:37.553
I loved it.

00:00:37.553 --> 00:00:40.500
There's just famous
people very close to you

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:41.960
which is like a real delight.

00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:44.060
- Yeah, well when they're a delight.

00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:45.460
- Well yes, but they're all.

00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:46.870
Well, they're walking
around with publicists,

00:00:46.870 --> 00:00:49.846
so they don't have time
to be mean, you know, but

00:00:49.846 --> 00:00:50.679
(audience laughs)

00:00:50.679 --> 00:00:54.187
I saw Viola Davis, and I love Viola Davis.

00:00:54.187 --> 00:00:55.330
- Me too
- I also saw

00:00:55.330 --> 00:00:56.830
her on a plane recently, and I was like,

00:00:56.830 --> 00:00:58.030
I need to talk to her.

00:00:58.030 --> 00:00:59.960
But then I was like, she's
living her life don't do it.

00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:03.300
So, I didn't do it, but then at the Emmys,

00:01:03.300 --> 00:01:04.447
I was like, "This is a work event,

00:01:04.447 --> 00:01:05.820
"I can talk to whoever I want!"

00:01:05.820 --> 00:01:07.265
- [Kelly] It is a work event.

00:01:07.265 --> 00:01:09.260
- I just picture two
people on your shoulders

00:01:09.260 --> 00:01:10.845
just talkin' to you.
(all laugh)

00:01:10.845 --> 00:01:12.073
- Good cop, bad cop.

00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:16.131
- So I went up to her, and I
was like, "I am bothering you,

00:01:16.131 --> 00:01:18.930
"but I need you to know I love you."

00:01:18.930 --> 00:01:20.900
And she truly was like
half eating a hamburger

00:01:20.900 --> 00:01:22.604
and was like, "Mmhm."

00:01:22.604 --> 00:01:23.710
- Oh, my gosh.

00:01:23.710 --> 00:01:24.860
- [Nicole] She was very sweet.

00:01:24.860 --> 00:01:26.780
- That's awesome, yeah, no, she's amazing.

00:01:26.780 --> 00:01:27.760
I'm a big fan of hers.

00:01:27.760 --> 00:01:30.510
Have you fanned out over anybody before?

00:01:30.510 --> 00:01:31.563
- Stevie Wonder

00:01:31.563 --> 00:01:32.730
- [Kelly] Well

00:01:33.858 --> 00:01:35.820
(audience claps)

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:38.410
- I recently, well, a couple years ago,

00:01:38.410 --> 00:01:40.760
I got the chance to work with him.

00:01:40.760 --> 00:01:42.323
He worked on one of my songs.

00:01:43.260 --> 00:01:47.660
Went into his studio where
he actually can function

00:01:47.660 --> 00:01:50.450
in the entire studio, walk
around with nobody's help.

00:01:50.450 --> 00:01:52.490
He knows exactly where everything is.

00:01:52.490 --> 00:01:56.137
And every time he comes
across to you, he be like,

00:01:56.137 --> 00:01:57.900
"Nice to see you Jason, nice to see you."

00:01:57.900 --> 00:02:00.848
I'm like Stevie, "Stop, stop,
with the nice to see you."

00:02:00.848 --> 00:02:02.885
(audience laughs)

00:02:02.885 --> 00:02:04.312
- You're hilarious.

00:02:04.312 --> 00:02:05.697
That's awesome though he
knows where everything is.

00:02:05.697 --> 00:02:06.570
That's awesome.

00:02:06.570 --> 00:02:08.140
It must be like a
comfortable place for him.

00:02:08.140 --> 00:02:10.530
- Yeah, yeah, I mean,
he's in there every day.

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:12.619
- You got to work with Stevie
Wonder, that's amazing!

00:02:12.619 --> 00:02:14.600
- That's cool.

00:02:14.600 --> 00:02:15.590
(audience claps)

00:02:15.590 --> 00:02:17.990
- There is an interesting story
about your drivers license

00:02:17.990 --> 00:02:18.950
which I kind of connect to,

00:02:18.950 --> 00:02:20.640
but I wanna hear yours, it's amazing.

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:22.820
- Okay, so I bought this big wig

00:02:22.820 --> 00:02:24.950
from a drag queen wig maker.

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:25.783
- [Kelly] As we do.

00:02:25.783 --> 00:02:27.680
- You know, I was truly feeling myself.

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:28.513
I was like,

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:32.350
the bigger the wig the closer to God.

00:02:32.350 --> 00:02:33.520
- [Kelly] Exactly.

00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:36.450
- So truly, that's how I walked
through the Glendale DMV,

00:02:36.450 --> 00:02:38.734
and everyone was like, "What is it?"

00:02:38.734 --> 00:02:39.890
(all laugh)

00:02:39.890 --> 00:02:41.630
And then in my Netflix special,

00:02:41.630 --> 00:02:43.220
currently streaming on Netflix,

00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:44.960
I have a joke about

00:02:44.960 --> 00:02:47.670
why is your weight on
your drivers license.

00:02:47.670 --> 00:02:49.490
Who's gonna question it?

00:02:49.490 --> 00:02:52.470
Like my drivers license
use to say 150 pounds,

00:02:52.470 --> 00:02:53.303
and I wrote it down,

00:02:53.303 --> 00:02:55.503
and the lady truly just
like squinted at me.

00:02:55.503 --> 00:02:56.336
(audience laughs)

00:02:56.336 --> 00:02:57.169
And I was like, I dare you.

00:02:57.169 --> 00:02:59.690
I dare you to say something.

00:02:59.690 --> 00:03:01.280
She didn't say anything, so I was like

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:03.574
the next time I get it renewed
I'll put 90 pounds, so I put

00:03:03.574 --> 00:03:06.640
- You legit have 90 pounds?

00:03:06.640 --> 00:03:08.853
- My drivers license says 90 pounds.

00:03:08.853 --> 00:03:11.186
(all laugh)

00:03:12.789 --> 00:03:13.930
- That's the greatest.

00:03:13.930 --> 00:03:15.860
Like has anyone seen it?

00:03:15.860 --> 00:03:18.360
Like when you show people,
has anyone said anything?

00:03:18.360 --> 00:03:20.143
- Nobody has clocked it, but
I'm waiting for someone to be,

00:03:20.143 --> 00:03:21.740
"Where, in your leg?"

00:03:21.740 --> 00:03:23.961
(all laugh)

00:03:23.961 --> 00:03:25.170
I can't wait.

00:03:25.170 --> 00:03:27.370
I'm gonna put like two
pounds the next time.

